></article-meta></front><body><p><bold>Correction to</bold>: <italic>British Journal of Cancer</italic> (2006) <bold>94</bold>, 1918&#x02013;1920. doi:<related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" id="N0x9e02268N0x9fecd80" ext-link-type="doi" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="10.1038/sj.bjc.6603198">10.1038/sj.bjc.6603198</related-article></p><p>Owing to an author error, G Gilliland was incorrectly named as contributing to this work. The authors would like it to be known that the correct list of authors who contributed was, therefore:</p><p>BU Mueller, T Pabst, P Hauser, D Neuberg and DG Tenen.</p></body></article>